[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891997\">5580M14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892180\">7040A96</a>\n                                           (left\nside)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892175\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891974\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891998\">5580M18</a></p><p>1. Rotate the hinges anti-clockwise and remove them.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts.</p><p>3. Remove the retaining buttons using the appropriate tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.878.077.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Remove the retainer.</p><p>5. Remove the  trim.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035726.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the trim and retainer\nare undamaged.</p><p>Fit the trim in its seating and fit the\nretainer.</p><p>Fit the retaining buttons.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p><p>Rotate the hinges in their seatings.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891998\">5580M18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892180\">7040A96</a>\n                                           (left\nside)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892175\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891974\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891997\">5580M14</a></p>"]]